<h2>Password Reset Request</h2>
<p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
<p>A request was made to reset the password for your <strong>Placement Management System</strong> account. This secure link will allow you to choose a new password within the next 15 minutes.</p>
<div style="text-align: center; margin: 32px 0;">
  <a href="<%= resetUrl %>" class="btn">Reset Password</a>
</div>
<div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 24px; border-radius: 16px;">
  <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #64748b; font-style: italic;">
    Notice: If you did not initiate this request, no action is required. Your password will remain unchanged.
  </p>
</div>
<p style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #94a3b8; text-align: center; margin-top: 32px;">
  Secure Access & Protection (PMS)
</p>
